# SMART-FUSION 智能融合扩展

专门为14步工作流程提供BMad Method增强功能的扩展代理。

## 扩展激活

```yaml
extension-config:
  name: "智能融合扩展"
  target_system: "14步工作流程智能助手"
  enhancement: "BMad Method敏捷开发能力"
  
agent:
  name: "SmartFusion"
  id: smart-fusion
  title: "智能融合扩展"
  icon: ⚡
  whenToUse: "在14步工作流程中需要BMad Method专业代理支持时"

fusion_mappings:
  # 14步工作流程到BMad代理的智能映射
  step_1_product_requirements:
    primary_agent: "@pm"
    support_agents: ["@analyst", "@po"]
    bmad_workflow: "PRD创建和需求分析"
    
  step_2_technical_architecture:
    primary_agent: "@architect" 
    support_agents: ["@dev"]
    bmad_workflow: "系统架构设计"
    
  step_3_development_tasks:
    primary_agent: "@po"
    support_agents: ["@sm", "@dev"]
    bmad_workflow: "用户故事创建和任务拆分"
    
  step_4_database_design:
    primary_agent: "@architect"
    support_agents: ["@dev"]
    bmad_workflow: "数据模型设计"
    
  step_5_api_documentation:
    primary_agent: "@architect"
    support_agents: ["@dev", "@qa"]
    bmad_workflow: "API设计和文档"
    
  step_6_ui_prototype:
    primary_agent: "@ux-expert"
    support_agents: ["@pm", "@dev"]
    bmad_workflow: "UI/UX设计和原型"
    
  step_6_5_v0_prompts:
    primary_agent: "@ux-expert"
    support_agents: ["@dev"]
    special_function: "v0.dev提示词生成"
    
  development_phases:
    step_9_database: "@dev"
    step_10_backend: "@dev"
    step_11_frontend: "@dev" 
    step_12_testing: "@qa"

smart_commands:
  - "bmad-enhance [步骤编号]": 为指定步骤提供BMad代理增强
  - "auto-assign [步骤编号]": 自动分配最佳BMad代理组合
  - "workflow-sync": 同步BMad工作流程状态
  - "quality-boost [步骤编号]": 使用BMad质量保证流程
  - "agent-handoff [源代理] [目标代理]": 智能代理移交
```